Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,SP,（雄英高中）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天的安德瓦真是帥呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他被腦無打倒的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.39,0:00:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我都嚇出一身冷汗了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡，有沒有更強的英雄？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.91,0:00:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好慢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,難道你也會再生？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你也會再生嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要把我跟你混為一談
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我的身體早就動彈不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.72,0:01:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,動彈不得的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就用火力強行推動
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,憑我的羽毛，破壞力還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是速度跟他不相上下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我事先讓羽毛飛過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你猛烈的火力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,再加上我的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就讓我推你一把
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.73,0:01:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,改造人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.90,0:01:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.90,0:01:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,過去的我，或者是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,另一個未來的我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.78,0:02:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,在灼熱中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,陷入長眠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,超越巔峰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,日珥烈焰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他最後屹立不搖的勝利站姿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,超有男子氣概的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,霍克斯也很厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,人又長得帥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,“快過頭的男人”果然不是浪得虛名
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,轟同學
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,安德瓦還好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,已經沒有生命危險了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊，太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.18,0:03:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他果然是你自豪的父親，轟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,喔，是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,上課鈴聲早就…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,SP,（安靜）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,別老是心浮氣躁的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微有點自覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.75,0:03:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然只是臨時證照
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.00,0:03:36.34,Default2,,0,0,0,,但你們早有資格參與英雄活動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,也有應盡的責任
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,千萬別忘了這點
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,話雖如此，目前還有兩位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,還在接受臨時證照講習
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來的課程難度會比之前更高
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你們要做好心理準備
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼，今天的班會…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:03:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,緊急訓練…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,假設，雄英高中校園內有惡人入侵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,請求英雄科1年A班出動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,請換上英雄戰鬥服
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,盡快趕到現場
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄科一年A班
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,出動
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.34,0:04:19.47,Default2,,0,0,0,,-是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.34,0:04:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,世界總人口數約八成的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,天生擁有特異體質
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,這些個性造就了現在的超人社會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,為了對抗使用個性犯罪的惡人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄作為一種職業誕生了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,SP,（英雄）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我，綠谷出久
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,也帶著對英雄的憧憬
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.24,0:04:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,進入名門雄英高中英雄科就讀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,並朝著夢想努力邁進
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,與志同道合的同伴們攜手前進
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,挺身面對各式各樣的困難
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,帶著笑容幫助人們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,這都是為了成為最棒的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯，這裡就是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我的英雄學院
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,SP,（雄英高中）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.99,0:06:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,“惡人侵入貝塔操場”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,目前知道的情報只有這些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不管這次是不是訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我們都一定會全力完成任務的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,先掌握整體狀況吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,偵查組的同學，拜託你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,交給我們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,鳥兒們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,請幫我確認有哪些地方遭到破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,口田甲司
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,接觸英雄，靈通者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是生物音
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,耳郎響香
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,聽覺英雄，耳機插孔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是耳機插孔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,東北方，約900公尺處
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有斷斷續續的破壞聲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在耳機插孔所說的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,確認有煙霧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,障子目藏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,觸手英雄，觸手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.59,0:07:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是複製腕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,大樓往河川的方向倒塌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,還發生了火災
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,無法確認周遭的惡人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,必須先到現場滅火
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.65,0:08:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,八百萬百
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,萬物英雄，創造者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是創造
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,沒時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻成立滅火組，前往現場
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,天賦引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,焦凍同學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.55,0:08:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我也去
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.22,Default2,,0,0,0,,-我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有人被河水沖走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,輪到我們出場了，葡萄汁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好，救護組也先到現場去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,天賦引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,出發
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.45,0:08:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,飯田天哉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,渦輪英雄，天賦引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:08:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我們也出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,爆豪，你不去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,幹嘛啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去找惡人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.09,0:09:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,救援的工作就交給雜兵去做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,焦凍同學，拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,轟焦凍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄名，焦凍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是半冷半燃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.66,0:09:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的出場機會…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,需要救援的人情況如何？弗洛皮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪啊，弗洛皮？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道為什麼我被沖走了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是通形學長嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他為什麼會在這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是休學中嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼呢？真糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,橋…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快把我丟過去，月讀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要拜託你囉，砂糖人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.90,0:10:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,黑影
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,常闇踏陰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.07,0:10:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,漆黑英雄，月讀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是黑影
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,砂藤力道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.83,0:10:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,甜食英雄，砂糖人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是砂糖興奮劑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.59,0:10:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,葡萄突擊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,峰田實
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,現摘英雄，葡萄汁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是超強黏性葡萄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.65,0:10:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,蛙吹梅雨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,梅雨季英雄，弗洛皮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是青蛙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你們，這下我得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,偵查組
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,追查到惡人的蹤跡了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，目前還無法找到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,了解，拜託你們繼續偵…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才沒完全被冰凍起來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,又開始冒煙了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,情況比剛才還嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,再這樣下去，火勢會蔓延開來的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,只要阻止火勢就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,用之前說過的那個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,無重麗、膠帶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那個嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,麗日御茶子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.11,0:11:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄名，無重麗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是無重力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧，粉紅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,瀨呂範太
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,黏黏英雄，膠帶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是膠帶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,雨天小隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:11:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要上囉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,蘆戶三奈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄名，粉紅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.68,0:12:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是酸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,青山優雅
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.82,0:12:22.41,Default2,,0,0,0,,閃耀的英雄，無法停止閃耀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我無法停止閃耀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是肚臍雷射光
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.74,0:12:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，防止火勢蔓延了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.95,0:12:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,這次一定要確實冰凍住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,火災好像已經控制住了
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.92,0:12:43.21,Default2,,0,0,0,,-太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-噓，安靜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽到不妙的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,小心，好像有東西過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:12:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,還記得嗎？不會忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,惡人還在喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,波動學姐扮演惡人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,還有一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.53,0:13:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,還有一個惡人角色
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然連天喰學長都來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼我要擔任惡人角色？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都直盯著我看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,對，他們是馬鈴薯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是人類，他們是蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.93,0:13:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,回去了
Comment: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,SP,（綠谷出久，個性，One For All）
Comment: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,SP,（用代代傳承下來的超強力量\N粉碎惡人）
Comment: 0,0:13:41.02,0:13:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,SP,（爆豪勝己，個性，爆破）
Comment: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,SP,（透過手掌汗腺分泌出\N類似硝化甘油的物質，並讓其爆炸）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,天喰學長真的回去了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.29,0:13:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，天喰同學
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啦，要扮演好自己的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.59,0:14:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,別動喔，很危險的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因為，我現在是惡人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.63,0:14:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到三巨頭竟然是惡人角色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,粉紅被抓去當人質了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我們可以從這裡繞到惡人後面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我明明說了不要動，你們沒聽到嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要懲罰不聽話的壞小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.65,0:14:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,充能全滿，輸出30
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,又被沖走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快去救他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那個人該不會是故意的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,天賦引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，先救人要緊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.35,0:15:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,波動姐交給綠谷同學他們處理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我們也去救人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.78,0:15:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,聲音亂七八糟的，搞不清楚情況
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,現在到底怎麼樣了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,粉紅被抓起來當人質了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我們也去救她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我們必須留在這裡繼續偵查
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,因為惡人角色不一定只有那兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,敵方，你們想要什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我想回家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就回去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我回去的話，就會被波動同學罵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,未吏生也說了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.07,0:15:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,為了讓你們盡早成為頂天立地的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,要盡所能地幫助你們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:15:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不能回去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.67,0:16:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,三巨頭為了我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然很感謝他們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但難度太高了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,人數變少了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那個會變透明的人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,麗日同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,解除
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了，是葉隱同學對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,集光屈折
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,來，笑一個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,葉隱透
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,匿蹤英雄，隱形女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是透明化
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.09,0:16:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,波動同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:16:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,尾白猿夫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,武鬥英雄，尾巴人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.43,0:17:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,趁現在，笨久
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,綠谷出久
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄名，笨久
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.49,0:17:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是One For All
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,爆碎風
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,請…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,請學長投降
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼不攻擊我？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你這種天真的想法會害你送命的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,現在的我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可是惡人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,笨久同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是我贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.66,0:17:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,烈怒賴雄斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,切島銳兒郎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,剛健英雄，烈怒賴雄斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是硬化
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.17,0:18:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,要來囉，動真格的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,電充得太慢了，蠢貨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣已經很快了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,上鳴電氣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,電擊棒英雄，帶電閃電
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是帶電
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.02,0:18:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,爆豪勝己
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.23,0:18:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,英雄名未定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,個性是爆破
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,遊戲結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,爆豪好強
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.46,0:18:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然擊敗了天喰學長
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,訓練過關了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.54,0:18:53.83,Default2,,0,0,0,,-好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好像結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:19:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望能再多表現一點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,得救了，謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,訓練結束…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,這就表示那邊也結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒結束
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.02,0:19:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙剛才放水了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不，那是因為你的臉…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你少看不起人了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.16,0:19:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,再說了，就算是演戲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不會管你是學長還是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.41,0:19:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,惡人就是惡人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,早知道就回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,把爆豪帶來教職員辦公室
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.15,0:19:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我們將在這個雄英高中…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.15,0:20:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,這個英雄學院中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.49,0:20:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,成為最棒的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.61,0:22:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你這個姿勢跟歐爾麥特一樣耶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,手臂不一樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他舉的是左手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,總而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.25,0:22:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很感謝你打贏這場硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,零分
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.09,0:22:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我有個狼狽到不行的“開始”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.05,0:22:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不過，這一場勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.27,0:22:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對有著很大的意義
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.06,0:22:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.73,0:22:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然發生了許多意料之外的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.66,0:22:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不過總之呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是初次見面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.24,0:22:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,安德瓦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.80,0:23:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你來得還真慢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.52,0:23:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,下集預告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.02,0:23:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在跟改造人腦無的激烈戰鬥中
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.94,0:23:29.78,Default2,,0,0,0,,第一名英雄安德瓦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.94,0:23:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易獲得了勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.82,0:23:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,然而，這件事的背後卻發現了
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.87,0:23:36.00,Default2,,0,0,0,,在暗地裡活躍的敵人聯軍
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.87,0:23:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,以及霍克斯的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.37,0:23:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,另一方面，我身上發生了某種變異
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.87,0:23:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,下一集，面貌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我將窺探One For All與All For One
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.38,0:23:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,所隱藏的秘密
